WEBVTT

00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:43.625 --> 01:44.625
You wanted the Bangladesh

01:44.705 --> 01:46.025
petrochemical industry
analysis report, right?

01:46.105 --> 01:47.705
I'll send it over in a bit.

01:48.745 --> 01:49.705
Xiaoyezi.

01:50.585 --> 01:51.625
Xiaoyezi!

01:51.705 --> 01:52.865
Here!

01:52.945 --> 01:56.945
I just… For a second there,
I felt like I'd traveled back in time.

01:57.545 --> 01:59.785
Back when I was the study committee member
calling roll, you'd always say, "Here!"

01:59.865 --> 02:01.385
Really loud.

02:01.905 --> 02:03.105
Really?

02:03.705 --> 02:04.945
What's wrong?

02:05.465 --> 02:07.105
You sound all muffled tonight.

02:07.745 --> 02:08.785
Tell me about it.

02:08.864 --> 02:11.105
I can't have you calling me Ikkyu-san
all this time for nothing.

02:11.745 --> 02:12.665
Nothing much.

02:13.585 --> 02:16.385
Maybe I'm just tired lately.
Got distracted.

02:17.345 --> 02:18.505
I heard it.

02:18.585 --> 02:21.265
You've been fidgeting
with your periodic table, haven't you?

02:24.145 --> 02:25.785
Ever since your father passed,

02:25.865 --> 02:28.945
you started collecting
the elements on the periodic table.

02:29.825 --> 02:31.225
You said you lost your dad,

02:31.865 --> 02:34.105
and at least collecting them all

02:34.185 --> 02:35.665
would make you feel
like you owned the world.

02:36.305 --> 02:39.865
So you only fidget
with your treasures when you're upset,

02:39.945 --> 02:42.025
clinking and clanking them around
like just now.

02:42.625 --> 02:44.345
Come on. What happened?

02:45.545 --> 02:46.625
Nothing.

02:51.865 --> 02:53.105
I've fallen for someone.

03:05.865 --> 03:06.705
But?

03:08.425 --> 03:11.185
But it was over before it even started.

03:12.385 --> 03:13.225
It's okay.

03:14.025 --> 03:15.145
I've really come to terms with it.

03:17.385 --> 03:21.225
Like looking through the giant eye
of a deep-sea blue hole,

03:22.945 --> 03:26.265
all the beauty is just an illusion.

03:29.385 --> 03:31.065
What does he mean by that?

03:36.785 --> 03:38.545
Do you think
he's actually working right now?

03:39.745 --> 03:42.545
Or like me, unable to focus on anything?

03:53.825 --> 03:55.305
I have to do something.

04:07.465 --> 04:08.825
Got home safe?

04:12.665 --> 04:13.505
Yeah.

04:13.585 --> 04:16.425
XU CHI

04:16.504 --> 04:17.624
Working?

04:21.585 --> 04:23.825
No. Just staring into space.

04:35.985 --> 04:37.785
YANG RUI

04:42.505 --> 04:43.665
ANSWER

04:46.825 --> 04:47.665
Hello?

04:49.505 --> 04:50.785
Are you asleep?

04:51.825 --> 04:52.865
Not yet.

04:53.585 --> 04:54.545
What's up?

04:56.985 --> 04:58.305
I have something to tell you.

05:01.545 --> 05:02.585
Xu Chi.

05:04.905 --> 05:05.945
I like you.

05:07.105 --> 05:07.985
I know you take time to warm up to people.

05:08.785 --> 05:12.345
So I held back.
I didn't want to pressure you.

05:12.425 --> 05:14.465
But when you pulled
your hand away just now,

05:14.545 --> 05:15.745
it really hurt.

05:19.825 --> 05:20.945
I…

05:21.025 --> 05:23.545
Tell me… Was I… Was I not good enough?

05:24.145 --> 05:28.905
So, is there nothing about me
that attracts you?

05:28.985 --> 05:31.225
That's not it. You're great.

05:32.505 --> 05:33.625
Then can we give it a try?

05:33.705 --> 05:35.025
Just a try.

05:35.665 --> 05:37.905
You can call it off anytime.

05:38.465 --> 05:39.305
Alright?

05:41.145 --> 05:42.225
Please say something.

05:48.985 --> 05:50.345
-Okay.
-Really?

05:50.425 --> 05:51.625
Really.

05:51.705 --> 05:53.305
Then tomorrow, when I hold your hand,
you can't pull away.

05:54.825 --> 05:59.345
Uh, let's talk about tomorrow
when it comes.

05:59.865 --> 06:02.265
I… I'm a bit confused right now.

06:02.945 --> 06:03.825
Good night.

06:05.705 --> 06:06.905
YE THE LEGEND SENT AN IMAGE

06:14.545 --> 06:15.385
UNLOCK THE SECRETS OF EXECUTION

06:16.905 --> 06:19.105
This should help with
the implementation phase of your proposal.

06:19.185 --> 06:20.385
Already emailed it to you.

06:21.065 --> 06:23.105
You need to organize
the documents this week.

06:23.185 --> 06:25.145
Make sure to confirm the timelines.

06:28.505 --> 06:31.745
See? He's totally fine.

06:32.305 --> 06:34.145
Stop overthinking, will you?

06:39.265 --> 06:40.825
This is well noted.

06:44.025 --> 06:45.705
We have no shared interests
or common ground!

06:45.785 --> 06:47.145
So let's break up, okay?

06:47.225 --> 06:49.425
Did you actually like me
when we got together?

06:49.505 --> 06:51.145
Am I just a replacement for someone else?

06:52.465 --> 06:53.625
Say it!

06:53.705 --> 06:55.705
Explain it to me! Say it!

07:40.305 --> 07:43.065
I just got the official notice
from Celestial Insurance.

07:43.145 --> 07:44.865
They've adopted our Plan B!

07:59.345 --> 08:00.825
Maxmise's signature celebration.

08:00.905 --> 08:02.785
Only happens for big wins.

08:03.985 --> 08:07.065
Xu Chi. You deserve
the most credit for this one.

08:22.145 --> 08:22.985
Thank you, everyone.

08:23.065 --> 08:26.585
I… I just threw out a rough idea
to spark conversation.

08:26.665 --> 08:28.305
I'm still new at this,
so I have a lot to learn

08:28.385 --> 08:29.345
from all of you

08:29.425 --> 08:31.625
when it comes to refining
the draft going forward.

08:31.705 --> 08:33.225
No excessive modesty allowed.

08:33.305 --> 08:35.065
You're an SBA now.

08:35.144 --> 08:36.505
No pretending to be a rookie.

08:49.345 --> 08:51.105
-Ms. Xu!
-What a coincidence.

08:51.185 --> 08:52.745
Heading to Celestial?

08:52.825 --> 08:54.705
You and your boyfriend just got together.
Why isn't he driving you?

08:55.425 --> 08:58.105
He's going to HQ. I'm going to the branch.
We're not going the same way.

08:59.625 --> 09:00.665
I actually have a project over that way.

09:00.745 --> 09:02.665
-I'll give you a ride.
-That'd be great.

09:08.265 --> 09:11.865
So you admit Yang Rui is your boyfriend?

09:14.425 --> 09:16.985
If you want to ask about Tianna,
just say it.

09:17.065 --> 09:18.865
Stop beating around the bush.

09:19.385 --> 09:20.465
Alright. Got it.

09:20.545 --> 09:23.105
So with you, I can't be subtle.
I have to be direct, right?

09:23.865 --> 09:27.385
I saw her staring at her desk
for a long time

09:27.465 --> 09:29.185
after the meeting,
before she started working.

09:29.785 --> 09:31.585
Did she get chewed out during the meeting?

09:32.105 --> 09:33.145
No way.

09:33.745 --> 09:35.465
Ma Ke is too smooth for that.

09:35.985 --> 09:38.025
Whether he messed me over
or I messed him over,

09:38.105 --> 09:40.305
he acts like nothing ever happened.

09:40.385 --> 09:42.225
The client didn't pick Tianna's proposal.

09:42.305 --> 09:43.385
Ma Ke gave her comfort and encouragement.

09:43.985 --> 09:44.825
He just assigned her

09:44.905 --> 09:47.305
the same amount of work
that he gave me at the meeting.

09:47.385 --> 09:49.785
He made sure to show
his expectations and regard for her.

09:52.145 --> 09:53.465
That's good.

09:54.145 --> 09:55.385
I'm relieved.

09:57.265 --> 10:00.105
So the rumor was true then.

10:00.185 --> 10:01.625
Ma Ke did steal your proposal.

10:02.385 --> 10:04.225
Then what are you going to do?

10:04.305 --> 10:05.145
Just take it

10:05.225 --> 10:08.145
and finish this project under him,
all nice and polite?

10:09.105 --> 10:09.945
What else can I do?

10:11.425 --> 10:13.945
You can't go through life
without taking a few hits.

10:15.185 --> 10:19.905
I got bitten, so I showed a little fang
to make sure he doesn't try it again.

10:19.985 --> 10:21.785
That's mission accomplished.

10:25.505 --> 10:26.625
What?

10:27.225 --> 10:28.705
Something's off.

10:29.465 --> 10:30.625
You're off.

10:30.705 --> 10:33.705
Look. If you have someone you like
and you won a project,

10:33.785 --> 10:35.425
you should be happy.

10:35.505 --> 10:36.905
You don't seem excited at all.

10:38.265 --> 10:40.625
I am excited. Super excited.

10:40.705 --> 10:42.985
Stop pretending to be a shrink.

10:43.065 --> 10:45.265
Oh, come on. That's your idea of excited?

10:45.345 --> 10:47.345
And I haven't even gotten
to the shrink part yet.

10:47.425 --> 10:51.225
See, when I'm pursuing Tianna,
I'm always on edge,

10:51.305 --> 10:52.265
worrying about her every second.

10:52.345 --> 10:54.785
Even the tiny, trivial stuff
matters to me.

10:54.865 --> 10:55.905
But you?

10:55.985 --> 10:58.105
You're totally calm
when Yang Rui's brought up.

10:58.705 --> 11:01.225
And I'm close with him,
but you never ask me anything.

11:01.305 --> 11:03.705
You don't ask about his likes or habits.

11:04.305 --> 11:08.665
So, there is always only one truth.

11:09.385 --> 11:10.625
You don't like him that much.

11:12.745 --> 11:14.425
Stop playing detective.

11:14.985 --> 11:17.385
We agreed. We're just giving it a shot.

11:17.465 --> 11:19.465
Maybe we'll grow on each other.

11:20.265 --> 11:22.945
Love is a spark,
not something you force until it fits.

11:23.025 --> 11:27.065
Alright, alright. Detective Zhaonan,
since you're so clear-headed,

11:27.585 --> 11:29.625
why are you still barking
up the wrong tree with Tina?

11:30.825 --> 11:31.825
What are you talking about?

11:31.905 --> 11:35.105
She's not a wrong tree.
She's a prized orchid!

11:35.185 --> 11:36.865
Say that again.
I'll record it and send it to her.

11:36.945 --> 11:38.025
Sorry. I'm sorry.

11:39.465 --> 11:42.425
Even if you defend her behind her back,
she won't be moved when she hears it.

11:42.505 --> 11:44.545
It's fine. As long as you're moved.

11:44.625 --> 11:47.545
Then you can just step up
and become the official one.

11:47.625 --> 11:48.465
What?

11:48.545 --> 11:51.665
How did I never realize
we have such great chemistry?

11:51.745 --> 11:54.665
Look. We come from the same background.

11:54.745 --> 11:56.225
We have the same goals.

11:56.305 --> 11:57.825
We're both good-looking and capable.

11:57.905 --> 11:59.425
I have a car,
and you're buying an apartment.

11:59.505 --> 12:00.905
-Stop. I get it.
-In the future, we'll…

12:00.985 --> 12:02.785
You're like a werewolf.

12:02.865 --> 12:04.945
And Bu Tianna is your full moon.

12:05.025 --> 12:05.905
The moment she's mentioned,

12:05.985 --> 12:07.345
you start transforming
and talking nonsense.

12:11.865 --> 12:12.745
I'm speechless.

12:29.345 --> 12:30.425
PRIVATE, DO NOT ENTER

12:33.825 --> 12:34.945
Who's there?

12:35.545 --> 12:36.705
Miss.

12:41.825 --> 12:43.065
Scared me.

12:47.545 --> 12:48.625
What's wrong?

12:49.145 --> 12:50.025
What happened?

12:50.105 --> 12:52.185
Xiaojie's toy is in Miss Bu's room.

12:52.265 --> 12:53.105
He's fussing for it.

12:53.185 --> 12:54.745
I knocked.

12:54.825 --> 12:56.465
I thought no one
was in the room, so I came in.

12:57.185 --> 12:58.945
Let me say this again.

12:59.025 --> 13:01.825
Even if I'm not here, you're not allowed
in my room without my permission.

13:03.425 --> 13:04.465
Alright, alright.

13:04.545 --> 13:06.065
It was a misunderstanding. Go on.

13:06.145 --> 13:07.105
Xiaojie's waiting.

13:10.905 --> 13:11.745
Mom.

13:13.345 --> 13:14.265
We have so many rooms.

13:14.345 --> 13:16.025
Why do you have to keep
his toys in my room?

13:16.945 --> 13:18.305
You're hardly ever home.

13:18.385 --> 13:19.425
This room gets great sunlight.

13:19.505 --> 13:22.185
Sometimes, I have Xiaojie play in here.

13:22.265 --> 13:25.385
He gets some sun
without getting dirty in the yard.

13:26.225 --> 13:27.825
So after I get married,

13:27.905 --> 13:30.105
I won't even have the right
to live in this house anymore?

13:30.185 --> 13:32.105
You're overthinking again.

13:32.185 --> 13:34.385
We're family. What's wrong
with using your room?

13:35.945 --> 13:39.505
When you were little,
you'd go into your dad's room

13:39.585 --> 13:41.785
and take over his desk to do homework.

13:41.865 --> 13:42.705
Don't you remember?

13:44.545 --> 13:45.785
We never got mad.

13:46.985 --> 13:50.705
Nana, you just think too much.

13:50.785 --> 13:54.705
I had Xiaojie
so you'd have another family member,

13:54.785 --> 13:56.425
not another enemy.

14:01.385 --> 14:04.305
Oh, your dad checked out a villa
in Sanya a while back.

14:04.385 --> 14:07.865
He said there's
a round room facing the ocean.

14:07.945 --> 14:09.665
You'd love it.

14:09.745 --> 14:12.865
It's for you and your future husband.

14:16.025 --> 14:16.905
Okay.

14:16.985 --> 14:18.785
I get it, Mom.

14:38.225 --> 14:39.385
Why are you back so late?

14:39.465 --> 14:40.985
Do you want something to eat?

14:57.425 --> 14:59.785
Did you tell Tianna
what I told you to say?

14:59.865 --> 15:02.625
Yeah. It actually worked.

15:02.705 --> 15:05.585
I'll drop another hint
tomorrow at breakfast.

15:05.665 --> 15:08.625
I'll tell her I spent half the night
rubbing your back.

15:08.705 --> 15:10.665
She'll feel bad for you
when she hears that.

15:10.745 --> 15:12.065
If I keep saying it,

15:12.145 --> 15:14.705
she'll surely want
to come home more often.

15:15.465 --> 15:17.945
But we have to take it step by step.

15:18.025 --> 15:21.745
We can't let Tianna
stay so hostile toward Xiaojie.

15:21.825 --> 15:23.265
Then bring it up with her more often?

15:23.345 --> 15:27.945
Tell her how many favors you called in
to help her with that insurance project.

15:28.025 --> 15:29.985
She's still too naive.

15:30.065 --> 15:31.865
Does she really think
that bringing a few gifts

15:31.945 --> 15:33.265
and being polite

15:33.345 --> 15:37.705
would make people hand over
such important internal research data?

15:37.785 --> 15:39.185
That was all because of my connections.

15:39.265 --> 15:42.545
Wait, if you helped her out,
why did you go out of your way

15:42.625 --> 15:44.305
to have someone
tell Mr. Zheng at Celestial

15:44.385 --> 15:46.545
to reject her proposal?

15:47.745 --> 15:50.105
She went into consulting
without my permission.

15:50.185 --> 15:54.425
Back when she landed the Ande Energy deal,
she was so full of herself.

15:55.745 --> 15:58.945
If I didn't knock her down a peg
this time,

15:59.025 --> 16:00.865
she'd think she's invincible.

16:01.585 --> 16:07.225
Give her a few setbacks at work,
then shower her with warmth at home.

16:07.305 --> 16:08.985
With a bit of push and pull like this,

16:09.065 --> 16:12.465
it won't be long
before she feels burned out at Maxmise.

16:12.545 --> 16:16.905
Then, getting her back to our company
will just fall into place.

16:16.985 --> 16:21.145
How can you use business tactics
against your own daughter?

16:22.505 --> 16:24.385
That's not fair to say.

16:24.465 --> 16:26.025
I'm doing this for her own good.

16:26.105 --> 16:27.545
But what about Tianna?

16:27.625 --> 16:30.265
She's always so rebellious,
always pushing back against me.

16:30.345 --> 16:32.065
Don't keep calling her Tianna.

16:32.145 --> 16:34.545
It's Nana. It's Nana.

16:48.305 --> 16:49.465
Ms. Zhu, look.

16:49.545 --> 16:52.185
I've already divided this project
into four modules.

16:52.825 --> 16:54.785
You take these four modules and…

16:55.905 --> 16:57.145
-Hold on.
-Do you need a break?

16:57.225 --> 16:58.225
I'm fine.

17:01.665 --> 17:04.625
Morning. I brought you some rice balls.

17:05.145 --> 17:06.585
Breakfast made with love?

17:08.305 --> 17:10.424
Ma Ke said Celestial is having
a company-wide team-building this weekend.

17:10.505 --> 17:12.184
So our team gets a half day off.

17:12.265 --> 17:13.745
Want to think about where
we should go this weekend?

17:15.944 --> 17:17.865
Some girl from the consulting firm
just passed out!

17:18.505 --> 17:19.345
Tianna.

17:19.424 --> 17:21.625
Wake up. Are you okay?

17:21.704 --> 17:23.665
-Wake up
-Should we call an ambulance?

17:23.745 --> 17:24.585
-Let me help you up.
-Excuse me. Let me through.

17:24.665 --> 17:25.944
I'm from Maxmise. Thanks.

17:26.025 --> 17:27.944
Tianna! What happened?

17:28.025 --> 17:29.785
-Help her sit up.
-Are you alright?

17:30.385 --> 17:31.265
Easy, easy.

17:31.785 --> 17:32.705
What happened?

17:33.545 --> 17:35.025
Come on, sit down.

17:35.105 --> 17:36.025
Nothing serious.

17:36.105 --> 17:37.705
-Probably low blood sugar.
-Careful.

17:37.785 --> 17:39.505
Do you have any white chocolate

17:39.585 --> 17:40.585
-or sugary drinks here?
-I have juice.

17:40.665 --> 17:41.505
Okay.

17:45.145 --> 17:46.265
Here, have some.

17:46.345 --> 17:48.025
How do you always manage
to pass out right when I happen

17:48.105 --> 17:48.945
to have juice?

17:49.785 --> 17:51.145
The Actuarial Department is brutal.

17:51.225 --> 17:53.105
Two whole days, and you wouldn't
let her leave the conference room.

17:53.185 --> 17:55.345
Even if she needed to verify the data,
she didn't have to push herself that hard.

17:55.425 --> 17:57.345
Hey, that's not on us.

17:57.425 --> 17:59.265
We told her so many times.

17:59.345 --> 18:00.225
She refused to leave.

18:00.305 --> 18:01.265
We brought food in
and she didn't touch it.

18:01.345 --> 18:02.745
Have some more.

18:03.265 --> 18:04.785
-Keep some chocolate
-Excuse me.

18:04.865 --> 18:06.145
-in your bag from now on.
-Excuse me.

18:08.465 --> 18:09.665
Sorry, everyone. Break it up.

18:09.745 --> 18:10.905
Don't crowd around, alright?

18:10.985 --> 18:12.065
-Thank you all.
-Feeling any better?

18:13.745 --> 18:14.985
-Thanks.
-Thanks. Leave this to me.

18:15.065 --> 18:17.825
Maybe you should take her to the hospital?

18:17.905 --> 18:18.945
Okay. Let me check.

18:20.665 --> 18:22.785
Tianna, are you alright?
Want to go to the hospital?

18:23.385 --> 18:25.745
No need. I… I can still work.

18:25.825 --> 18:27.145
-Don't move.
-No, no…

18:27.225 --> 18:28.145
Don't worry about work.

18:28.225 --> 18:30.025
Just go home and rest.

18:30.665 --> 18:32.945
Xu Chi, you're a girl.
It's better if you take her home.

18:33.025 --> 18:35.065
-Go ahead and take her back.
-I'll take her.

18:35.865 --> 18:37.505
Have the chocolate first.

18:55.025 --> 18:56.185
Let me get your bag.

18:56.265 --> 18:57.785
No, no need.

18:58.385 --> 18:59.905
Easy now.

18:59.985 --> 19:01.905
There's no one else here.
No need to put on a brave face with me.

19:01.985 --> 19:03.665
You were breaking out
in a cold sweat in the car.

19:04.705 --> 19:07.545
Chi, are you happy seeing me like this?

19:08.425 --> 19:09.825
You've never seen me
so pathetic, have you?

19:11.265 --> 19:14.065
Missy, would you be happy
if you saw me down and out?

19:14.665 --> 19:15.785
Maybe.

19:19.545 --> 19:21.945
What's really going on with you?

19:22.745 --> 19:23.585
-I am fine.
-You wouldn't

19:23.665 --> 19:25.865
push yourself this hard just for work.

19:25.945 --> 19:27.825
Is your family giving you trouble again?

19:29.585 --> 19:30.665
Why put yourself through this?

19:30.745 --> 19:33.905
It's not like you just found out
your parents favor boys over girls.

19:36.465 --> 19:38.345
They don't just favor boys.

19:39.105 --> 19:41.945
They team up to put me down and lie to me.

19:43.225 --> 19:45.425
You think your proposal
was really that good?

19:45.505 --> 19:46.505
It wasn't.

19:47.305 --> 19:50.425
My dad had someone reach out
to Mr. Zheng at Celestial

19:50.505 --> 19:51.625
to reject my proposal.

19:51.705 --> 19:53.185
That's how you got the chance.

19:54.345 --> 19:55.545
Why?

19:57.625 --> 19:59.825
They want me back at Siwei Group early,

19:59.905 --> 20:03.425
just to play second fiddle
to their precious son Bu Tianjie.

20:04.025 --> 20:05.945
Xiaojie is still young.

20:06.025 --> 20:09.065
He won't be able to take over
until he finishes his master's degree.

20:10.025 --> 20:12.625
And that's at least 20 years from now.

20:12.705 --> 20:14.625
I can't be everywhere at once.

20:14.705 --> 20:19.705
I need someone I can trust
to watch over the business for Xiaojie.

20:21.665 --> 20:27.025
I wanted to get into consulting
because it's the fastest way to grow.

20:27.785 --> 20:31.745
If I can become a partner
at a top consulting firm by 35,

20:31.825 --> 20:34.145
no one can question my ability
to be the successor.

20:35.105 --> 20:37.385
But they won't even give me that chance.

20:37.465 --> 20:39.145
They just want me
to go back to the company now.

20:39.225 --> 20:40.065
They're gaslighting me.

20:40.145 --> 20:42.865
They want me to be a stepping stone
for their precious son.

20:44.865 --> 20:46.345
Very hilarious.

20:46.425 --> 20:48.625
Let me show you.
This is what my parents say.

20:49.425 --> 20:52.905
Give her a few setbacks at work,

20:52.985 --> 20:56.345
then shower her with warmth at home.

20:56.425 --> 20:58.105
With a bit of push and pull like this,

20:58.705 --> 21:03.305
getting her back to our company
will just fall into place.

21:04.425 --> 21:06.905
"Start her at the very bottom of finance.

21:06.985 --> 21:08.385
She won't be able to pivot later anyway.

21:08.465 --> 21:10.825
At worst, we can trap her
with a General Manager title.

21:10.905 --> 21:14.505
We can always have a CEO
and Board Chairman above that."

21:16.025 --> 21:17.225
My mom is even funnier.

21:17.865 --> 21:19.225
My brother is this young,

21:19.305 --> 21:21.225
and my mom already has my dad
taking my brother to observe sales.

21:21.305 --> 21:24.905
She says nothing matters more than sales.

21:26.065 --> 21:29.345
So don't try to comfort me
with some flimsy words.

21:29.425 --> 21:30.465
You have no idea

21:30.545 --> 21:33.625
how painful it is to never
be the one chosen from the start.

21:34.825 --> 21:36.025
I do.

21:37.265 --> 21:40.385
I know what it feels like
to never be the one chosen

21:40.465 --> 21:41.505
from the start.

21:42.145 --> 21:44.785
That's why I let Ye Xinzhi go.

21:47.105 --> 21:48.425
Why are you so stupid?

21:50.185 --> 21:51.545
Where are you going?

21:52.425 --> 21:53.265
Don't hold me back.

21:53.345 --> 21:55.065
I'm going to go settle things
with that scumbag.

21:55.145 --> 21:56.705
-You…
-He works at C&amp;C,

21:56.785 --> 21:58.145
-across from Maxmise, right?
-What are you going to do?

21:58.225 --> 21:59.985
I'm going to kill him! That scumbag.

22:00.065 --> 22:01.385
This is a lawful society.

22:01.465 --> 22:03.185
Listen to me. He didn't do anything to me.

22:03.265 --> 22:04.705
You're so silly.

22:04.785 --> 22:06.825
He fooled you
and you're still defending him?

22:06.905 --> 22:09.105
I know these polished scumbags
inside and out.

22:09.185 --> 22:10.025
Back in college,

22:10.105 --> 22:11.465
two of my roommates
got wrecked by guys like him.

22:11.545 --> 22:13.305
No initiating. No refusing.
No taking responsibility.

22:13.385 --> 22:14.225
Sleep with you

22:14.305 --> 22:16.225
-and then turn cold as ice.
-Stop, stop.

22:16.825 --> 22:18.505
Nothing happened between us.

22:18.585 --> 22:20.225
I just didn't want to keep

22:20.305 --> 22:23.025
playing that ambiguous game anymore,
so I told him I had a boyfriend.

22:23.105 --> 22:24.065
You dumped him?

22:29.025 --> 22:31.665
I'm dizzy. I'm so dizzy.

22:31.745 --> 22:32.705
Oh my.

22:33.425 --> 22:34.745
Drink some more juice.

22:36.905 --> 22:41.825
It took me a long time
to finally realize one thing.

22:43.225 --> 22:45.305
That I like Ye Xinzhi.

22:49.385 --> 22:50.865
I told you a long time ago.

22:50.945 --> 22:54.025
Posers like that
are absolute pros at flirting.

22:54.105 --> 22:56.465
You fall right in before you know it.
You just wouldn't listen.

22:56.545 --> 22:59.465
What good is me nagging you
every single day?

22:59.545 --> 23:01.425
Come on, I'm the one venting here.

23:01.505 --> 23:03.705
Do you have to fire back
at every single thing I say?

23:06.065 --> 23:08.505
Get this straight.
I'm the one who feels awful right now.

23:08.585 --> 23:11.385
You're drinking my wine,
eating my chips, and lying on my couch.

23:11.465 --> 23:12.785
I'm stuck on the floor.

23:12.865 --> 23:14.545
Is it too much to ask you to listen to me?

23:14.625 --> 23:15.465
Go on.

23:22.505 --> 23:24.065
Anyway,

23:25.585 --> 23:27.225
I realized I like him.

23:28.025 --> 23:31.825
But at my current level,
I… I'm not good enough for him,

23:31.905 --> 23:34.545
and I can't handle my own feelings.

23:35.305 --> 23:40.265
He said he has feelings for me,
but not romantic ones.

23:40.865 --> 23:46.305
I thought if I drew the line with him,
I could suppress my feelings.

23:46.385 --> 23:50.305
And then I'd just be content
as an admirer.

23:50.385 --> 23:55.185
But every time I see him with other women,

23:55.265 --> 23:59.865
I… I can't help feeling jealous
and disappointed.

24:02.745 --> 24:03.825
What did you say?

24:03.905 --> 24:06.065
So he's stringing you along
while flirting with other girls

24:06.145 --> 24:06.985
in front of you?

24:07.625 --> 24:09.785
Isn't that textbook scumbag behavior?

24:09.865 --> 24:11.465
I can't hold back anymore.

24:11.545 --> 24:13.025
-Where are you going?
-To beat him up.

24:15.825 --> 24:18.465
I never knew you were such a hothead.

24:20.945 --> 24:22.145
Because…

24:24.585 --> 24:25.545
Because my parents are even worse.

24:26.225 --> 24:27.305
But I still love them.

24:27.905 --> 24:31.025
So, I just take it out on other people.

24:35.385 --> 24:36.385
You still have me.

24:41.305 --> 24:42.585
I haven't settled the score with you yet.

24:43.905 --> 24:46.505
Ma Ke bullied you like that
a few days ago.

24:46.585 --> 24:47.705
Why didn't you tell me?

24:47.785 --> 24:50.305
You came to my place and told me…

24:50.385 --> 24:52.385
I'll hold nothing back from now on.

24:52.905 --> 24:56.065
I'll… hold… hold nothing back from now on.

24:56.145 --> 24:58.065
"I… I… I'm going to do
this and that to you.

24:58.145 --> 25:00.305
I'm declaring war on you."
Why do you flip-flop so much?

25:00.385 --> 25:02.425
-Did I say that?
-You want it one way,

25:02.505 --> 25:03.865
but you also want me
to tell you everything--

25:03.945 --> 25:05.625
Alright, alright. Come on.

25:05.705 --> 25:06.545
Cheers.

25:12.945 --> 25:18.585
Actually, I was pretty torn that day.

25:19.185 --> 25:24.825
But when I saw Ye Xinzhi looking so down,
I knew he must have seen me with Yang Rui.

25:24.905 --> 25:27.545
So, for some crazy reason,
I just said yes to Yang Rui.

25:27.625 --> 25:29.065
But I don't regret it at all.

25:29.145 --> 25:31.745
Because Yang Rui is honestly a great guy.

25:31.825 --> 25:34.185
And Ye Xinzhi has so many admirers.

25:34.265 --> 25:36.625
I want to be the one who moves on first.

25:36.705 --> 25:37.945
I want to find my own happiness.

25:38.025 --> 25:40.585
That way, he'll remember me.
He'll be shocked.

25:40.665 --> 25:43.905
He'll realize that losing my feelings
was a huge loss!

25:44.825 --> 25:46.265
Oh my goodness.

25:46.345 --> 25:48.145
Well said!

25:48.225 --> 25:49.105
Keep going!

25:49.185 --> 25:50.425
-Ouch.
-Don't lose the momentum.

26:04.305 --> 26:05.465
Bu Tianna,

26:06.945 --> 26:10.505
I've actually been pretty upset
these past few days.

26:12.305 --> 26:17.425
It's this bitter, twisting pain inside.

26:18.985 --> 26:20.705
It hurts so much I can't even sleep.

26:24.225 --> 26:26.625
So I actually sympathize with Zhao Heng.

26:28.505 --> 26:32.585
Because I know
he likes you the way I like Ye Xinzhi.

26:34.465 --> 26:39.185
Maybe his reasons for getting
close to you aren't entirely pure,

26:40.305 --> 26:42.345
but his feelings are real.

26:45.145 --> 26:46.425
How do you know?

26:50.185 --> 26:52.305
Because at our core,

26:53.105 --> 26:55.545
he and I are the same kind of person.

27:13.465 --> 27:16.185
So I actually sympathize with Zhao Heng.

27:16.265 --> 27:20.745
Because I know
he likes you the way I like Ye Xinzhi.

27:22.025 --> 27:23.065
Maybe

27:23.665 --> 27:26.225
his reasons for getting close to you
aren't entirely pure,

27:26.865 --> 27:28.865
but his feelings are real.

27:43.545 --> 27:44.465
What are you doing?

27:44.545 --> 27:48.185
Video calling someone
out of the blue is rude.

27:48.265 --> 27:50.505
Wait, just hear me out. Where are you?

27:50.585 --> 27:51.425
Are you okay?

27:51.505 --> 27:52.625
Didn't Xu Chi tell you?

27:52.705 --> 27:54.025
Xu Chi?

27:54.105 --> 27:55.585
Xu Chi is with you?

27:56.465 --> 27:57.745
Where are you? Put her on the phone.

27:57.825 --> 27:58.945
She's not here.

27:59.025 --> 28:00.545
I'm at home. I'm fine.

28:00.625 --> 28:01.745
Fine?

28:02.785 --> 28:03.625
You're not lying to me?

28:03.705 --> 28:05.665
I wouldn't waste
that kind of energy on you.

28:08.585 --> 28:09.785
That's a relief.

28:16.225 --> 28:17.945
Are you at a construction site?

28:23.465 --> 28:24.305
There's no elevator here.

28:24.905 --> 28:27.145
I ran all the way down
from the 17th floor.

28:29.785 --> 28:31.865
No signal or power on the 17th floor?

28:31.945 --> 28:34.745
And couldn't you catch your breath
before talking to me?

28:34.825 --> 28:37.185
You're just guilt-tripping me
for sympathy.

28:37.265 --> 28:38.505
Still got the energy to snap at me.

28:39.145 --> 28:40.665
That means you're fine.

28:41.305 --> 28:42.705
I really didn't think that far at first.

28:42.785 --> 28:44.065
I just panicked.

28:44.145 --> 28:45.745
I figured I'd drive over
to find you first.

28:46.505 --> 28:47.785
But I only knew
which building you were in.

28:47.865 --> 28:48.705
I didn't know your unit number.

28:48.785 --> 28:51.105
Besides, even if I went,
the security guard wouldn't let me in.

28:51.185 --> 28:52.385
I'm such an idiot.

29:00.865 --> 29:02.625
Hello? Why is it lagging?

29:03.505 --> 29:04.545
Can you hear me?

29:05.105 --> 29:07.145
Is my signal bad? Here.

29:07.225 --> 29:09.145
Let me… Let me call you back.

29:09.745 --> 29:11.145
I want ice cream.

29:12.825 --> 29:16.945
When I was little,
I loved ice cream from fast food places.

29:17.625 --> 29:23.265
Because they had sweet ice cream
and lots of kids.

29:23.825 --> 29:25.545
But my parents said it was junk food.

29:25.625 --> 29:27.745
They wouldn't let me have any.

29:27.825 --> 29:29.185
So after I started school,

29:29.265 --> 29:33.625
I went a really long time
without ice cream or fries or anything.

29:34.225 --> 29:36.465
But the more they tried to stop me,
the more I wanted to do it.

29:36.545 --> 29:37.705
I'm in Unit 1902.

30:25.025 --> 30:27.425
Hello, little Tianna.

30:28.105 --> 30:32.425
I'm your Uncle Buka.

30:32.505 --> 30:37.865
I'm here to bring you joy and happiness.

30:48.785 --> 30:49.865
Why are you leaving?

30:49.945 --> 30:51.345
What, Uncle Buka?

30:51.425 --> 30:53.225
What cartoon has a character that ugly?

30:53.305 --> 30:54.585
That's terrible!

31:12.505 --> 31:15.945
I didn't really watch TV much anyway.

31:16.465 --> 31:18.945
When I went to the shop
to borrow the costume,

31:19.625 --> 31:22.785
they told me
all the ones I knew were already taken,

31:22.865 --> 31:23.865
or I'd have to wait.

31:23.945 --> 31:26.865
But I couldn't wait a single minute.

31:28.185 --> 31:29.065
But that's okay.

31:32.345 --> 31:39.185
From now on,
I'm your personal magic elf, Uncle Buka.

31:44.665 --> 31:46.385
You did this on purpose!
You're so annoying!

31:46.465 --> 31:48.185
You're so sneaky. You did this on purpose.

31:48.265 --> 31:50.785
You're just trying to move me
with this cheap little thing, right?

31:51.385 --> 31:53.065
You think I'd fall for that?

31:53.145 --> 31:55.625
Men are all the same.

32:03.905 --> 32:05.025
Stop hitting me.

32:06.225 --> 32:07.705
If you keep that up…

32:09.585 --> 32:12.985
Uncle Buka might turn
into the Big Bad Wolf.

32:14.425 --> 32:15.345
You wouldn't dare.

32:28.025 --> 32:30.185
Alright. The magic transfer is complete.

32:30.265 --> 32:31.585
Time for good food.

33:02.745 --> 33:05.905
From now on, Uncle Buka
will always be with you.

34:16.824 --> 34:18.625
You actually let him into your place?

34:20.185 --> 34:22.105
You actually tipped him off?

34:22.705 --> 34:25.985
He and I aren't that close. Okay?

34:26.585 --> 34:28.744
Well, things between him and me
aren't what you think.

34:28.824 --> 34:30.304
Stop making up stories.

34:31.985 --> 34:34.304
You let him in. You hugged, and you cried.

34:34.385 --> 34:35.585
And I'm making things up?

34:38.185 --> 34:39.065
He and I are just…

34:41.945 --> 34:43.985
Fine. I'm all physical, no feelings.

34:44.065 --> 34:45.865
Who do you think I am? I am Bu Tianna.

34:45.945 --> 34:46.784
Get it straight.

34:46.865 --> 34:49.385
You're a total cold-hearted player.

34:51.385 --> 34:53.505
Aren't you afraid
of falling for it one day?

34:55.385 --> 34:56.304
Well…

34:56.385 --> 34:57.945
Right back at you. You're no different.

34:58.025 --> 34:58.865
Let me tell you,

34:58.945 --> 35:00.905
even though the project team
used your proposal,

35:00.985 --> 35:02.625
you didn't really beat me.

35:08.225 --> 35:09.985
Then I'll just wish you good health.

35:10.065 --> 35:12.145
And I'll wish you
all the happiness in love.

35:17.345 --> 35:18.505
A face-to-face showdown?

35:18.585 --> 35:20.225
Classic top-tier consultants.

35:20.305 --> 35:21.185
Impressive.

35:21.265 --> 35:22.265
Don't get the wrong idea.

35:22.345 --> 35:24.185
Our team's fights
are always quite civilized.

35:24.265 --> 35:25.865
Never this explosive.

35:27.825 --> 35:30.065
I'm just kidding. Don't take it seriously.

35:37.345 --> 35:40.145
When we talk to them later,
listen more and talk less.

35:44.105 --> 35:45.785
Miss Xu, your package.

35:45.865 --> 35:47.345
Your colleague asked me to bring it over.

35:47.425 --> 35:48.305
Thanks.

35:49.385 --> 35:50.425
Package?

36:11.665 --> 36:13.785
Came across this old postcard by chance.

36:13.865 --> 36:16.225
Returning the best times to you.

36:16.905 --> 36:17.745
From Ye Xinzhi.

36:19.825 --> 36:20.865
What's wrong?

36:25.025 --> 36:26.145
Sorry I'm late.

36:26.225 --> 36:27.145
Mr. Sun.

36:29.305 --> 36:30.225
-Hello.
-Hello.

36:30.305 --> 36:32.305
After getting the full lay of the land,
Maxmise's preliminary recommendation

36:32.385 --> 36:34.785
is to work out
a microservices architecture plan.

36:34.865 --> 36:35.705
Hold on.

36:35.785 --> 36:36.945
FRONTEND AND BACKEND ADMIN PANEL

36:37.025 --> 36:38.705
A microservices architecture plan?

36:40.625 --> 36:42.545
I told you we already have SOA.

36:43.825 --> 36:44.905
Please take a closer look.

36:45.505 --> 36:48.665
We modeled this after Ansheng,
the biggest insurer in the Netherlands.

36:48.745 --> 36:49.665
Compared to SOA,

36:49.745 --> 36:51.825
it's better suited for Celestial's
future development.

36:51.905 --> 36:53.705
So everything I just said was for nothing?

36:53.785 --> 36:56.505
Or was I speaking a foreign language
that you can't even understand?

36:57.825 --> 36:58.825
Fine. Let me ask you.

36:58.905 --> 37:00.385
What makes microservices better than SOA?

37:04.225 --> 37:07.025
Microservices are essentially
a more decentralized version of SOA.

37:07.705 --> 37:09.505
Mr. Sun, you're absolutely right.

37:09.585 --> 37:11.865
But based on Maxmise's assessment,

37:11.945 --> 37:12.865
a more flexible microservices approach

37:12.945 --> 37:14.985
would better support
Celestial's future growth.

37:15.065 --> 37:16.545
This transformation has to happen,

37:16.625 --> 37:19.385
so please make sure to fully cooperate
with us on the redevelopment.

37:19.465 --> 37:20.545
And this also needs

37:20.625 --> 37:23.025
to be included in the delivery report
with an implementation timeline.

37:23.105 --> 37:27.105
So, Mr. Sun, how about three months? Four?

37:27.985 --> 37:31.025
Wait, Mr. Sun,
that's not what our team lead meant.

37:31.585 --> 37:34.145
Microservices are lightweight and compact,
commonly used by internet companies.

37:34.225 --> 37:35.945
SOA is an enterprise-level,
large-scale architecture.

37:36.025 --> 37:38.065
That's basic knowledge.
Anyone in IT knows that.

37:38.145 --> 37:39.265
You mentioned the Netherlands earlier.

37:39.345 --> 37:41.145
So tell me, how many people
does the entire Netherlands have?

37:41.225 --> 37:43.425
Of course, their insurance companies
can use microservices.

37:43.505 --> 37:44.945
We have hundreds of millions of customers!

37:45.545 --> 37:46.545
Our SOA works perfectly fine,

37:46.625 --> 37:48.145
and you want us
to just switch to microservices?

37:48.225 --> 37:49.585
And get it done in three months?

37:49.665 --> 37:50.865
Do you have any idea
how much work that is?

37:51.465 --> 37:52.945
You might as well tell me
to fly to the moon!

37:53.025 --> 37:53.905
Wait, Mr. Sun.

37:55.385 --> 37:57.745
Mr. Sun. Please don't be upset.

37:57.825 --> 37:58.665
-Mr. Sun.
-We can…

37:58.745 --> 38:00.465
We can discuss the specifics.

38:00.985 --> 38:02.065
Miss Xu,

38:02.145 --> 38:03.745
I was there the day you presented
your proposal.

38:03.825 --> 38:05.385
Honestly, I was moved.

38:05.465 --> 38:06.985
I thought you were someone
who gets things done.

38:07.585 --> 38:10.425
But after today's conversation,
a saying comes to mind.

38:10.945 --> 38:14.345
"I thought you were impressive,
until you started talking about my field."

38:15.745 --> 38:18.545
Oh, and please don't come
to the IT Department anymore.

38:18.625 --> 38:19.865
It saves everyone's time.

38:34.185 --> 38:35.345
Xu Chi.

38:35.945 --> 38:36.945
Xu Chi!

38:39.945 --> 38:41.025
Xu Chi.

38:41.625 --> 38:42.825
Maybe it's your first time
seeing someone blow a fuse,

38:42.905 --> 38:43.825
so you can't handle it,

38:43.905 --> 38:45.185
but this kind of thing
happens all the time.

38:45.265 --> 38:46.545
How could you make the decision

38:46.625 --> 38:48.825
to replace the entire SOA
without discussing it with me?

38:51.145 --> 38:52.185
I'm the team lead.

38:52.265 --> 38:53.785
The plan is mine to decide.

38:53.865 --> 38:55.145
And using precedent cases
from the reference library

38:55.225 --> 38:56.705
is standard Maxmise practice.

38:58.345 --> 38:59.865
I'm not questioning you.

38:59.945 --> 39:03.145
I just think if we'd discussed it first,
Mr. Sun wouldn't have pushed back so hard.

39:05.545 --> 39:06.705
This time we just got unlucky.

39:06.785 --> 39:07.985
This is the first time
I've run into someone like that.

39:08.585 --> 39:09.505
Maxmise isn't magic.

39:09.585 --> 39:11.665
How could we possibly know
every company's technical details?

39:11.745 --> 39:13.625
Just showing them a tiny bit
is more than enough.

39:23.825 --> 39:26.145
You mentioned SOA earlier.

39:26.225 --> 39:27.465
You actually know about that stuff.

39:27.545 --> 39:29.105
I think we should revise the plan.

39:29.185 --> 39:31.905
At least don't make Celestial
replace their entire service architecture.

39:31.985 --> 39:34.465
No. You need to listen to me on this.

39:34.545 --> 39:35.705
The plan is solid.

39:35.785 --> 39:37.305
Mr. Sun just isn't ready to accept it yet.

39:37.385 --> 39:39.505
Give him the cold shoulder for a few days,
and he'll come around.

39:39.585 --> 39:41.305
We've always done it this way.

39:42.465 --> 39:44.465
But that's not how you solve--

39:50.865 --> 39:52.025
Hello, Ma Ke.

39:52.105 --> 39:54.065
Yes. Yes.

39:54.145 --> 39:56.705
I don't know why Mr. Sun
blew up like that.

39:56.785 --> 39:59.025
Don't worry. I'll convince him.

40:01.745 --> 40:02.585
Xu Chi…

40:03.345 --> 40:04.225
Alright. Okay.

40:04.825 --> 40:05.825
I'll tell her.

40:13.025 --> 40:14.345
Ma Ke said

40:14.945 --> 40:17.665
Mr. Sun has been flat-out refusing
to change the IT architecture

40:17.745 --> 40:19.185
and has such a strong reaction to you,

40:19.265 --> 40:20.545
so there's definitely more to this story.

40:20.625 --> 40:23.745
He said he'll look into it,
and we should put this on hold.

40:24.745 --> 40:25.745
Put it on hold?

40:26.305 --> 40:27.985
What does that mean? Is work on pause?

40:28.065 --> 40:29.105
What am I supposed to do then?

40:30.265 --> 40:32.785
How about you organize
the requirements for the sales-side app?

40:33.585 --> 40:34.425
That's simple.

40:34.505 --> 40:36.145
I'll gather feedback

40:36.225 --> 40:37.785
on the IT Department
from other departments.

40:37.865 --> 40:39.905
As for Mr. Sun…

40:41.465 --> 40:44.825
I'll figure out a way
to put some pressure on him.
